## What This Skill Provides

- Zod runtime validation schemas
- Exhaustive type checking with `assertNever`
- End-to-end type safety (frontend ↔ backend)
- tRPC patterns (if used)
- Prisma type generation patterns

## Critical 2025 Patterns

- **Zod validation on ALL API responses** - Never use `await response.json() as Type`
- **Exhaustive switch statements** - Always include `assertNever` in default case
- **Runtime validation** - Type assertions are not type safety

## When to Use

- Validating API responses
- Creating form validation schemas
- Ensuring exhaustive type coverage
- Building type-safe API clients
- Preventing runtime type errors

